00:17:01.070 --> 00:17:04.970
So it's powerful apps
for your business.

00:17:04.970 --> 00:17:07.220
The key benefits in this
case is that you can

00:17:07.220 --> 00:17:09.800
create applications very fast.

00:17:09.800 --> 00:17:11.720
It's all integrated
within G Suite,

00:17:11.720 --> 00:17:17.569
so you can make use of all the
G Suite APIs, the Google APIs.

00:17:17.569 --> 00:17:21.380
You can also make use of
the Google Cloud Platform

00:17:21.380 --> 00:17:22.300
