00:17:22.300 --> 00:17:25.280
So for example, if you want to
store your data in the Cloud

00:17:25.280 --> 00:17:27.920
SQL, yeah, you can easily
just connect to that

00:17:27.920 --> 00:17:30.740
and set that up.

00:17:30.740 --> 00:17:34.100
Data binding-- so once you have
your data in your application,

00:17:34.100 --> 00:17:36.950
you can very easily just
bind it to a widget,

00:17:36.950 --> 00:17:39.410
