00:17:42.020 --> 00:17:44.900
Because it's in the Google
domain, it's all secure,

00:17:44.900 --> 00:17:46.340
and nobody else can get there.

00:17:46.340 --> 00:17:47.840
That also means
that you're building

00:17:47.840 --> 00:17:50.850
applications for a domain and
not really for an app store.

00:17:54.150 --> 00:17:59.460
Yeah, this answers the question
that a lot of companies

00:17:59.460 --> 00:18:03.420
and developers had,
where enterprises

00:18:03.420 --> 00:18:06.240
